#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.oxygenicon.metainfo.xml:15
msgid "Oxygen Icons"
msgstr "Oxygen ikone"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.oxygenicon.metainfo.xml:16
msgid "A free and open source icon theme to use with the Oxygen Plasma style"
msgstr ""
"Besplatna tema ikona otvorenog koda za korištenje uz Oxygen Plasma stil"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.oxygenicon.metainfo.xml:18
msgid "Oxygen Icons is a freedesktop.org compatible icon theme originally developed for the KDE Plasma desktop environment in combination with the Oxygen Style. It features smooth gradients, soft shadows, and a slightly glossy look."
msgstr ""
"Oxygen ikone su freedesktop.org kompatibilna tema ikona izvorno razvijena "
"za radno okruženje KDE Plasma u kombinaciji s Oxygen stilom. Odlikuju se "
"glatkim prijelazima boja (gradijentima), mekim sjenama i lagano sjajnim "
"izgledom."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.oxygenicon.metainfo.xml:26
msgid "Screenshot of KMail with the Oxygen style and icon theme."
msgstr "Snimka zaslona KMaila s Oxygen stilom i temom ikona."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.oxygenicon.metainfo.xml:32
msgid "This new release adds many new symbolic icons for the system tray."
msgstr "Ovo novo izdanje donosi mnoge nove simboličke ikone za sistemsku traku."